  "releaseNotes": "v10.0.10 (SpawnDev fork): SCTP FORWARD TSN (RFC 3758) on the receive side, so a peer that abandons unreliable chunks (partial reliability, e.g. maxRetransmits=0 video) no longer stalls the association; INIT advertises Forward-TSN-Supported; INIT parameter parsing fixed for short INITs.",
